{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S03、S08等段落把多个细碎情绪收束成完整感受句，少了X并列呈现微状态时那种颗粒丰富、可分别捕捉的感觉。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更适合边听边扫：话语中的重点突出，感受与叙事交替出现，不必在大量短词之间自行拼接意思。它不仅让人知道人物经历了什么，也把他为什么舍不得、为什么不敢回去、为什么最后选择带着想念继续生活交代得更连贯；感受部分还有呼吸、脉搏、脚步、停顿和声音变化等具体细节，能让普通观众感受到情绪如何发生和转变。X并非没有细腻内容，但右侧短词过于密集，尤其S03、S06、S07、S13，观众需要自己归类和串联，容易忙于读屏而顾不上听音乐。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "be29a08e-1b76-435c-bb80-01819ed67fad", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T020110866169Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:01:48.158668+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "eb073007d9fb20f8cf3997d9381f4485410a541f168b88b51274badfcda5c85b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308c